#X text 240 83 Reads the state of a connected gamepad and outputs events
for buttons \, axes \, and connections and disconnections of devices.
Button events are output from the first outlet \, axis events from
the second \, and device-related messages (connection \, disconnection
\, device info) from the third.;
#X text 240 184 Button names: south \, east \, north \, west \, ltrig
\, ltrig2 \, rtrig \, rtrig2 \, select \, start \, mode \, lthumb \,
rthumb \, up \, down \, left \, right \, unknown.;
#X text 240 239 Button events: pressed \, released \, repeated \, changed.;
#X text 240 264 Axis names: lstickx \, lsticky \, rstickx \, rsticky
\, leftz \, rightz.;
